        "quote": "/d͡ʑauzu/ → /d͡ʑɔːzu/ → /d͡ʑoːzu/"
      },
      {
        "quote": "From Middle Chinese compound 上手 (dzyangᴴ syuw^X, “to have the upper hand → to gain mastery, to master something”, literally “top hand”)."
